  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tax 102.02 “Accident, mistake, or misfortune” means something outside the party's own control and not due to neglect, or something that a reasonably prudent person would not be expected to guard against or provide for.\n\nSource. #2256, eff 1-2-83; ss by #2943, eff 12-31-84; EXPIRED: 12-31-90\n\nNew. #5638, eff 9-1-93; ss by #7068, INTERIM, eff 8-15-99, EXPIRES, 12-13-99; ss and moved by #7152, eff 12-10-99 (from Tax 101.02); ss by #8985, eff 9-24-07; ss by #10623, eff 6-26-14; ss by 13686, eff 7-19-23",
